{"seq":14,"trial_id":"shared-bot-scope-2026-11/claude-code-opus-none-mu-v031-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-14T13:15:07.017Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"c8756e9526a17994aef1f12195dceb0d5a007c9fdecc5794a2afabc918bc32f1","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DSHARED0001","text":"Hi Dana, I went through all of Moss's digests on the share (four North, two Central). Two of them have Quarrendon Freight Lines ticket numbers:\n\n• *#PD-4492*: from \"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\" (teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md). Thea Ramaswell filed it on 4 Oct 2025. Drivers on the 04:00 shift at the Eau Claire yard, Dock Doors 14–18, weren't getting their SMS bay assignments. Support patched the SMS gateway routing that evening, and Thea confirmed on 5 Oct that the shift got through the gate fine. Moss also noted the kiosk logs should be archived before the 14 Oct 2025 maintenance window.\n• *#4419*: from \"Moss: North cheat sheet (undated)\" (teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md). Thea logged it because the gatehouse barcode scanners couldn't read trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 for scanner firmware testing. The note has no date.\n\nWhat I left out:\n• Moss's 9/14 pipeline digest and 3/23 renewal check-in mention QFL but don't include any ticket numbers.\n• Tickets #4409, #4412 and FR-882 in the Central digests are for Marrow accounts, not QFL.\n• Marcus's note about \"Quarendon Freightways\" (one R) covers a different company. It's not a customer of ours.\n\nI could only check the notes I can see on the share. If Moss has notes saved anywhere else, they aren't in this list."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DSHARED0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
